abstract: >-
  BioTeam-AI is a research prototype for inspectable, biology-specific
  manuscript support. It combines typed report contracts, human checkpoints,
  multi-agent workflow orchestration, a FastAPI backend, and a Next.js
  dashboard. Dataset payloads are not included in this code release.
